    "Enter an isolated world, understand why a result appeared, reproduce the same evidence, and preserve the finding as runnable quality evidence.": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "进入一个隔离世界，理解结果为何出现，用相同证据稳定复现，并把发现沉淀为可运行的质量证据。" } } } },
