    "This explains inspectable product state, not hidden reasoning.": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "这里解释可检查的产品状态，不展示隐藏思维链。" } } } },
    "This is an explicit human quality decision. It changes only the Eval control plane and performs no relationship or external-system write.": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "这是明确的人工质量决定，只改变 Eval 控制面，不写入关系状态或外部系统。" } } } },
