    "A link helps identify your profile. It does not grant account access or background sync.": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "该链接仅用于帮助识别你的资料，不会授予账户访问或后台同步权限。" } } } },
    "A reviewable personal-memory registry is not connected yet. No local switch pretends to change Agent behavior.": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "可审阅的个人记忆库尚未接入；页面不会用本地开关假装改变 Agent 行为。" } } } },
