    "Habit and preference patterns will stay proposed until their source, scope, and deletion path are visible.": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "在来源、作用范围和删除路径清晰之前，习惯与偏好模式始终只是提议。" } } } },
    "Import support": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "导入支持" } } } },
    "Kept as an app preference until you clear it. It is never account authorization.": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "该链接会作为应用偏好保留，直到你主动清除；它绝不代表账户授权。" } } } },
    "LinkedIn": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "LinkedIn" } } } },
    "LinkedIn connections archive": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "LinkedIn 联系人归档" } } } },
    "LinkedIn profile URL": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "LinkedIn 个人资料链接" } } } },
    "LinkedIn reference added": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "已添加 LinkedIn 资料链接" } } } },
    "Memory can shape a proposal. It can never authorize an external action.": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "记忆可以影响提议，但永远不能授权外部行动。" } } } },
    "Memory scope": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "记忆范围" } } } },
    "Not added": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "未添加" } } } },
    "Not available": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "尚不可用" } } } },
    "One-way projection of confirmed events; each write stays reviewable.": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "仅单向投递已确认事件；每次写入仍可审阅。" } } } },
    "Personal memory": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "个人记忆" } } } },
    "Planned as a one-time, member-exported file with duplicate review.": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "计划支持成员主动导出的一次性文件，并在导入前审阅重复项。" } } } },
    "Planned sources are shown for capability clarity. They cannot be opened or mistaken for live connections.": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "计划中的来源仅用于说明能力，无法打开，也不会被误认为实时连接。" } } } },
    "Planned with field mapping, identity review, partial retry, and an import receipt.": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "计划支持字段映射、身份审阅、部分重试与导入回执。" } } } },
    "Profile reference": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "资料引用" } } } },
    "Relationship context": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "关系上下文" } } } },
    "Reviewed relationship context only": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "仅使用已审阅的关系上下文" } } } },
    "Scoped": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "按范围使用" } } } },
    "Shortcut ready": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "快捷指令已就绪" } } } },
    "Sources & imports": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "来源与导入" } } } },
    "Stages a selected screenshot for ordinary review.": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "把选中的截图暂存并进入常规审阅。" } } } },
    "The Agent can find, interpret, and prepare. You confirm every consequential change.": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Agent 可以查找、理解和准备；每个有后果的变更都由你确认。" } } } },
    "The Agent can use reviewed People and relationship evidence only when the current task brings that person into scope.": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "只有当当前任务明确涉及某人时，Agent 才能使用已审阅的人物与关系证据。" } } } },
    "Turns captured signals into reviewable relationship work.": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "把捕捉到的信号整理成可审阅的关系工作。" } } } },
    "YOUR AGENT": { "localizations": { "zh-Hans": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "你的 AGENT" } } } },
    " · due %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " · 截止 %@"
          }
        }
      }
