    "A Live Activity can show the trusted phase while you are away. When Actions are ready, review returns to the App.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你离开应用后，实时活动仍会显示可信的处理阶段；Actions 准备好时，审阅会回到应用内。"
