          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Talent Signal offers focused shortcuts for capture, review, and retrieval. Choosing one never confirms a fact or sends anything.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Talent Signal 提供聚焦于记录、审阅与找回的快捷指令；选择任一项都不会确认事实或发送内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Talent Signal offers three focused shortcuts. Choosing one never confirms a fact or sends anything.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Talent Signal 提供三个聚焦的快捷指令；选择任一项都不会确认事实或发送内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Talent Signal saves the event first, then syncs it one way. It never imports or rechecks Apple Calendar events.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
