      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图片仍保留在此设备上，尚未附加到任何人物。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Live Activity exposes phase and attention only. Candidate details and consequential controls stay inside Talent Signal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实时活动只展示阶段与是否需要关注；候选人详情和有后果的控制项留在 Talent Signal 应用内。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The local save failed, so the original session is still here. Nothing was removed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本机保存失败，因此原会话仍然保留，没有删除任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The on-device answer could not be protected in Sessions. Your message is still here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本地回答无法安全保存到会话中，你的消息仍保留在输入框。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original image stays on this device in the current slice. No contact, message, meeting, ATS, CRM, or reminder is written from selection alone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在当前版本中，原始图片仅保留在此设备上；仅选择图片不会写入联系人、消息、会议、ATS、CRM 或提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The person page is current": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "人物页已更新到当前状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The preview proposal could not be protected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "预览提议未能受到保护。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The preview reply could not be saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法保存预览回复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The prior screenshot was not retained. Reattach the same image to reconcile or retry its protected Run.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "之前的截图未被保留。请重新附加同一张图片，以核对或重试受保护的任务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The proposal could not be cleared from protected recovery. It remains open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法从受保护的恢复记录中清除此提议；提议仍保持打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The proposal is open, but this device could not protect it for relaunch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提议仍保持打开，但此设备暂时无法保护它以便重新启动后恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The question was sent to the governed workspace. Waiting for verified readback.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "问题已发送到受治理工作区，正在等待验证回读。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The relationship was found, but the Session could not save that context. Nothing was sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已找到相关关系，但会话无法保存该上下文。消息尚未发送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The reviewed evidence remains unresolved and cannot change any person Wiki until a recruiter resolves identity.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已审阅证据保持待核对；在招聘顾问解决身份前，它不会更改任何人物 Wiki。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The reviewed text is being stored as evidence. Identity remains unresolved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在将已审阅文字保存为证据；身份仍保持待核对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved review may or may not have applied. Check canonical readback before trying again; the same recovery reference will be used.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存的审阅结果尚不确定。重试前请先检查正式回读；系统会沿用同一恢复引用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The screenshot and your reviewed draft remain on this device. No person was changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "截图和已审阅草稿仍保留在此设备上；没有任何人物记录被更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The screenshot Run could not be protected for retry. Nothing was sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法为截图任务建立可安全重试的记录，因此没有发送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected file could not be opened. Your message is unchanged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法打开所选文件；你的消息没有改变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server found a relationship source whose current review or authorization changed. Your question is still here; inspect the relationship source before asking again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务端发现一条关系来源的审阅或授权状态已经变化。你的问题仍保留；请先检查关系来源，再重新提问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The signal remains in history": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该信号仍保留在历史中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Source and Draft are already saved locally. Either route creates a Proposal, not a fact; the manual route copies your exact Signal without model interpretation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "来源和草稿已在本地保存。任一路径都只会创建 Proposal，不会直接成为事实；手动路径会原样复制你的 Signal，不进行模型解读。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The source review was not saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "来源审阅未能保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The supplied identity handles conflict across more than one existing person.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提供的身份线索对应多位现有人物。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sync attempt could not be recorded in Talent Signal. Nothing was added to Apple Calendar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同步尝试无法记录到 Talent Signal，Apple 日历未发生更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The visible soul of your CRM": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的 CRM 的可见灵魂"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The workspace could not be reached. Check your connection and Tailscale, then retry. Your message is still here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法连接工作区。请检查网络和 Tailscale 后重试；你的消息仍保留在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These clues narrow the review; they never choose a person. Leaving identity unresolved is valid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些线索只用于缩小审阅范围，不会替你选择联系人；保留身份待核对也是有效结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These safeguards cannot be disabled in settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些安全措施无法在设置中关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These shortcuts open or stage review. They do not confirm candidate facts, send messages, create meetings, or write to an ATS or CRM.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些快捷指令只会打开或暂存审阅，不会确认候选人事实、发送消息、创建会议，也不会写入 ATS 或 CRM。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This answer did not complete": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这次回答没有完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This deletes this session’s local messages, Agent responses, and receipts. Saved drafts, People, Pursuits, and workspace evidence stay unchanged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会删除此会话在本机保存的消息、Agent 回复和回执。草稿、人物、目标空间和工作区证据都不会改变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This edit is visible, but it could not be protected for relaunch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此编辑当前可见，但暂时无法保护以便重新启动后恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This evidence contains a relative date. It remains quoted context, not a scheduled date; confirm the absolute date and timezone before creating a due Action.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这条证据包含相对日期。它仍只是引用上下文，并非已安排日期；创建带截止时间的 Action 前，请确认绝对日期与时区。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This exact fragment needs your current review before a new Agent answer may cite it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这条精确片段需要你完成当前审阅，新的 Agent 回答才能引用它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is preview data, so no question was sent. Open a signed-in workspace connected to the backend, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前是预览数据，因此问题没有发送。请打开已登录并连接后端的工作区，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This link anchors profile-aware imports and review later. It does not grant background sync by itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个链接会作为后续资料导入与审核的锚点，但它本身不会授权后台同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This person is not available in the current workspace.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前工作区中找不到这个人物。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This records a new recruiter review. It does not send the saved question or perform any external action.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会记录一次新的招聘顾问审阅，不会自动发送已保留的问题，也不会执行任何外部操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This relationship contains a source that is no longer current, reviewable, or authorized. Your question is still here; inspect the relationship source before asking again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这段关系中有一条来源已过期、尚不可审阅或不再具备授权。你的问题仍保留；请先检查关系来源，再重新提问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This relationship is selected, but the draft remains protected as a global draft until this device can save the move.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关系已选择；在此设备能够保存这次移动前，草稿仍作为全局草稿受到保护。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes the protected screenshot waiting for a Pursuit. It does not delete the original image from Photos or Files.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会移除等待归入 Pursuit 的受保护截图，不会删除照片或文件中的原图。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes the retained Share or Shortcut item and the local Draft, Proposal, and verified progress derived from it. It does not delete the original item from the source app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会删除保留的分享或快捷指令项目，以及由其派生的本地草稿、Proposal 和已验证进展。不会删除来源 App 中的原始项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This saves reviewed text and source metadata. It does not save the original image or bind a person yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会保存已审阅文字和来源元数据；尚不会保存原图或绑定人物。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This synthetic preview has no Proposal ID, so no confirmation control is available and nothing can be presented as applied.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个合成预览没有 Proposal ID，因此不提供确认控件，也不会把任何内容呈现为已应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This update needs review": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此更新需要审阅"
          }
        }
      }
    },
