    "Review import": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "审阅导入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review person": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "审阅联系人"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reviewable": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可审阅"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reviewed fields": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已审阅字段"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Row": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Same name only · not an identity match": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅姓名相同 · 并非身份匹配"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saved": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已保存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select Connections.csv from your member-requested export.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从你主动申请的导出文件中选择 Connections.csv。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Source attached to selected Person": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "来源已附加到所选联系人"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Source fingerprint %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "来源指纹 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The CSV contains an unfinished quoted field.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CSV 中存在未闭合的引号字段。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The contacts file needs a recognizable header row.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "联系人文件需要可识别的标题行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file encoding could not be read safely.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法安全读取此文件的字符编码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected file could not be read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取所选文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected file is empty.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选文件为空。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The vCard could not be read safely.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法安全读取此 vCard。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file could not be reviewed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法审阅此文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This import supports up to 5,000 rows at a time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "单次导入最多支持 5,000 行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This link belongs to a different platform.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此链接属于另一个平台。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This link or handle is not valid for that platform.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此链接或账号名不符合该平台格式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use file": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your profile references": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的资料引用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A current and historical owner conflict is active. Choose the current owner, remove the clue, or preserve an unresolved identity review.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前所有者与历史所有者存在冲突。请选择当前所有者、移除线索，或保留为待解决的身份审阅。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A live connection will show its exact read scope, last successful access, and revoke control here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实时连接会在这里明确显示读取范围、最近成功访问时间和撤销控制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose what this one reviewed source should change.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请选择这一个已审阅来源应当改变什么。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finish the existing protected contact review before starting another import decision.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先完成现有的受保护联系人审阅，再开始另一个导入决定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finish the protected review for %@ before importing another person.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先完成 %@ 的受保护审阅，再导入另一位联系人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Name-only matches are suggestions. Current or historical handle ownership stays visible and no match is selected for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅姓名相同只是建议。当前或历史账号归属会保持可见，系统不会替你选择匹配项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No Google account access has been granted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未授予 Google 账户访问权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No Microsoft account access has been granted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未授予 Microsoft 账户访问权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No supported match was found.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未发现可支持的匹配项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No valid email, phone, or HTTPS profile link was found.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未发现有效的邮箱、电话或 HTTPS 资料链接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One new Person and relationship context will be created after this exact review.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完成这次明确审阅后，将创建一位新联系人及其关系情境。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only mapped fields are held in this review. The selected raw file is not stored by Talent Signal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次审阅只保留已映射字段。Talent Signal 不会存储所选原始文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open one person to check identity and choose create, attach, or leave unresolved. No person is preselected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开一位联系人核对身份，再选择创建、附加或保留未解决。系统不会预选任何人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Organization and position remain source evidence in this slice; they are not silently promoted to confirmed profile fields.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在这一版中，组织和职位仍属于来源证据，不会被静默提升为已确认资料字段。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Person created from reviewed source": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已从审阅来源创建联系人"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Preview workspace: file review works, but no canonical Person can be saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "预览工作区：可以审阅文件，但无法保存正式联系人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These references describe how you identify yourself. They grant no account access, contact access, or background sync.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些资料引用描述你如何标识自己，但不会授予账户访问、联系人访问或后台同步权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The canonical save succeeded, but protected local recovery could not be cleared. Reopening still uses the same operation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正式保存已成功，但无法清除受保护的本地恢复状态。重新打开仍会使用同一操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The canonical save succeeded, but Session history could not be protected on this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正式保存已成功，但此设备无法安全保留会话历史。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file is parsed on this device and discarded after review. Nothing is merged on name alone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件只在此设备上解析，并在审阅后丢弃。不会仅凭姓名合并联系人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The reference could not be removed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法移除资料引用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The reference could not be saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法保存资料引用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The result is not assumed. Retry uses the same protected decision and cannot create a second operation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统不会假定结果。重试会使用同一受保护决定，不会创建第二个操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The result is unknown. Retry the same protected decision.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "结果未知。请重试同一个受保护决定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The reviewed source will attach to the selected Person and relationship.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已审阅来源将附加到所选联系人和关系。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The source will be kept for identity review without creating or attaching a Person.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "来源会保留用于身份审阅，不会创建或附加联系人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These column names remain visible for review, but their values are not imported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些列名会在审阅中保持可见，但其中的值不会被导入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This decision could not be protected for a safe retry. Nothing was sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法保护此决定以便安全重试。没有发送任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is an identity reference only. Talent Signal will not sign in, sync, or publish through it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这只是一条身份引用。Talent Signal 不会通过它登录、同步或发布。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This review can create one Person, attach the source to one existing Person, or preserve an unresolved identity case.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次审阅可以创建一位联系人、将来源附加到现有联系人，或保留一个未解决的身份案例。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use its CSV export for a reviewable snapshot today.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目前可使用其 CSV 导出创建可审阅的快照。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A contact field is too large to review safely.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "某个联系人字段过大，无法安全审阅。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A name is required before this row can be reviewed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要先补充姓名，才能审阅这一行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A non-HTTPS profile link will not be used as an identity clue.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "非 HTTPS 资料链接不会被用作身份线索。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Imported notes are excluded until a separate evidence review exists.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导入备注会被排除，直到完成独立的证据审阅。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needs attention": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要注意"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The invalid email will not be used as an identity clue.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无效邮箱不会被用作身份线索。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The invalid phone will not be used as an identity clue.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无效电话不会被用作身份线索。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This contacts file has too many columns.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此联系人文件包含过多列。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This exact identity clue already appears earlier in the file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这条完全相同的身份线索已在文件前面出现。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A screenshot received through this Shortcut confirms only the local handoff. It does not prove the current Action Button assignment.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "通过这个快捷指令收到截图，只能确认本地交接链路正常；不能证明当前操作按钮仍绑定在这里。"}}}},
    "Assign the Shortcut": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "绑定快捷指令"}}}},
    "Assigned": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "已绑定"}}}},
    "Build Shortcut": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "创建快捷指令"}}}},
    "Build Shortcut opens an empty editor. Shortcuts opens your existing shortcuts and app actions. Add these two actions in order, then give it a short name.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "“创建快捷指令”会打开一个空白编辑器；“快捷指令”会打开你现有的快捷指令和 App 操作。请按顺序加入这两个操作，再取一个简短名称。"}}}},
    "Build it once. Then press and hold without leaving the conversation.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "只需设置一次。之后长按即可，不必离开当前对话。"}}}},
    "Build the two-action Shortcut": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "创建两步快捷指令"}}}},
    "Capture Signal and Record Signal are App Shortcuts. Review screenshot is an action for a personal two-action Shortcut. Only you can map a Shortcut to the Action Button in Settings.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "“记录信号”和“录制信号”是 App 快捷指令。“审阅截图”则是个人两步快捷指令中的一个操作。只有你能在系统设置中把快捷指令绑定到操作按钮。"}}}},
    "Capture only a conversation you are authorized to use. The screenshot stays local until you review it. Reviewed text is sent only after you tap Save and check identity.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "只捕捉你有权使用的对话。截图会保留在本地，直到你审阅它。只有在你轻点“保存并核对身份”后，审阅后的文字才会发送出去。"}}}},
    "Choose a screenshot to review.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "选择一张要审阅的截图。"}}}},
    "First capture": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "第一次捕捉"}}}},
    "Give the personal Shortcut a short name you can recognize in Settings.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "给这个个人快捷指令取一个简短名称，方便你在系统设置中识别。"}}}},
    "I've assigned the Shortcut": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "我已绑定快捷指令"}}}},
    "Local before you decide": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "由你决定前，只保留在本机"}}}},
    "Local receipt": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "本地回执"}}}},
    "No screenshot is captured or uploaded during setup.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "设置过程中不会截取或上传任何画面。"}}}},
    "Not set up": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "尚未设置"}}}},
    "One-time setup": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "一次设置"}}}},
    "Only you can assign it in Settings. Talent Signal cannot read or change the Action Button binding.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "只有你能在系统设置中完成绑定。Talent Signal 无法读取或更改操作按钮的绑定。"}}}},
    "Open Shortcut editor": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "打开快捷指令编辑器"}}}},
    "Opens an empty Shortcut editor. Add the two actions above in order, then give it a short name.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "将打开空白的快捷指令编辑器。请按顺序加入上面的两个操作，再取一个简短名称。"}}}},
    "Opens an empty Shortcut editor. Add the two actions above in order.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "将打开空白的快捷指令编辑器。请按顺序加入上面的两个操作。"}}}},
    "Other shortcuts": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "其他快捷操作"}}}},
    "Ready for the first capture": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "等待第一次捕捉"}}}},
    "Receive one screenshot from a Shortcut and save it on this iPhone for editable text and identity review.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "从快捷指令接收一张截图并保存在这台 iPhone 上，用于可编辑的文字与身份审阅。"}}}},
    "Save one image on this iPhone for later text and identity review.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "在这台 iPhone 上保存一张图片，稍后审阅文字与身份。"}}}},
    "Saved locally in Talent Signal. Nothing was uploaded or confirmed.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "已在 Talent Signal 本地保存；没有上传或确认任何内容。"}}}},
    "Saved on this iPhone. Nothing was uploaded or confirmed.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "已保存在这台 iPhone 上；没有上传或确认任何内容。"}}}},
    "Screenshot received on this iPhone": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "这台 iPhone 已收到截图"}}}},
    "Screenshot received via Shortcuts": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "已通过快捷指令收到截图"}}}},
    "Shortcut assigned": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "快捷指令已绑定"}}}},
    "Shortcut received": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "已收到快捷指令截图"}}}},
    "Shortcut tested": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "快捷指令已测试"}}}},
    "Shortcut tested on this iPhone": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "已在这台 iPhone 上验证快捷指令"}}}},
    "Shortcuts opens your existing shortcuts and Talent Signal app actions.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "“快捷指令”会打开你现有的快捷指令和 Talent Signal App 操作。"}}}},
    "Swipe to Shortcut, then choose the personal Shortcut you just named.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "滑动到“快捷指令”，然后选择刚刚命名的个人快捷指令。"}}}},
    "System action": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "系统操作"}}}},
    "Take Screenshot": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "截屏"}}}},
    "Talent Signal action": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Talent Signal 操作"}}}},
    "Talent Signal received a screenshot through Shortcuts. It remains on this iPhone until you review or delete it.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Talent Signal 已通过快捷指令收到截图；在你审阅或删除前，它会保留在这台 iPhone 上。"}}}},
    "Talent Signal received a screenshot through Shortcuts. It stays in the local review queue until you review or delete it.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Talent Signal 已通过快捷指令收到截图；在你审阅或删除前，它会留在本地审阅队列中。"}}}},
    "The Shortcut editor opens empty. Add these two actions in order, then give it a short name. The first run stays local until you review and send.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "快捷指令编辑器会以空白状态打开。请按顺序加入这两个操作，再取一个简短名称。第一次运行只会保留在本机，直到你复核并发送。"}}}},
    "The button saves locally. Reviewed text is sent only after you tap Save and check identity; no candidate fact or external action is confirmed automatically.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "按钮只会在本地保存。只有在你轻点“保存并核对身份”后，审阅后的文字才会发送；候选人事实与外部操作都不会被自动确认。"}}}},
    "The first screenshot received through this action verifies the app-owned path automatically.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "通过此操作收到第一张截图后，App 会自动验证自己负责的接收链路。"}}}},
    "You confirm the assignment because iOS does not expose the current Action Button binding to this app.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "需要由你确认绑定，因为 iOS 不会向此 App 公开当前的操作按钮绑定。"}}}},
    "Your assignment is noted. Talent Signal will verify its own capture path when the first screenshot arrives.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "已记录你的绑定确认。第一张截图到达后，Talent Signal 会验证自己负责的接收链路。"}}}},
